      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You can do this by having the sender only be enabled for the local player. As a test, I made my sender exist locally on my avatar, so only I would see the receiver activate on another avatar. Was to demonstrate to someone that Avatar Dynamics are not network synced, they run on everyone's machine at the same time.\n(and to prove its possible to make a secret collision tag as a key to toggle things on my public avatars that only exist for me locally)\nThat requires you to have made the sender avatar though.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
